WEBVTT

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.265
"Romance is prohibited"

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:18.518
Romance is prohibited!

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.355
"Romance Prohibition Order"

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.484
Hey... who's that guy?

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:28.361
Is he affiliated with Neo-DEAVA?

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.571
A magician?

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.905
A clown?

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.699
What do you mean, "Romance is prohibited"?

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.451
After the wall is finally gone...!

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.453
That's right!

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.509
Welcome back, Director!

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:52.510
What?!

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.012
Director?!

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:02.979
"Romance is prohibited"

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:05.982
Director, please have some donuts.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:07.359
Thank you.

00:01:07.359 --> 00:01:09.903
Th-This girl is the Director?

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.739
That's right. And that person...

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:15.867
...is the Supreme Commander
of Neo-DEAVA, Zen Fudo.

00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:22.207
The Supreme Commander and the Director

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:26.795
have been traveling in order to
solve the mystery of Aquarion.

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:32.509
You're back now... Does that mean
that you've found some clues?

00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:35.261
I haven't been told anything...

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:39.182
...about the mystery you're talking about
or about the forbidden Aquarion.

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:43.603
Miss Suomi, you know the story
about Apollon and Silffy, right?

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:47.816
Of course, everyone knows that fairy tale.

00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:49.734
I think it was made into a movie, too.

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:52.362
If I remember correctly,
it was titled "Skies of Aquaria."

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:57.283
Right. 12,000 years ago, after the
battle against the Shadow Angels,

00:01:57.283 --> 00:02:01.955
the two lovers, Apollon and Silffy,
were separated.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:07.168
Excessive passion can sometimes
bring about destruction.

00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:11.589
Apollon and Silffy, the separated lovers,
yearning for one another...

00:02:11.589 --> 00:02:16.261
That is what is driving the Aquarion
revived in the modern era out of control.

00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:17.637
Out of control...

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:23.268
Because of that, Neo-DEAVA has sealed
away the true power of Aquarion.

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:26.479
You know about this
very well, right, Mr. Donar?

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:29.232
Yes, far more than I'd like.

00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:33.319
However, now that our
enemy is getting stronger,

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:37.115
Neo-DEAVA is under considerable
pressure to change its system.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:38.199
Right...

00:02:38.199 --> 00:02:42.871
Though its power is forbidden,
we have no choice but to depend upon it.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.336
A donut is an empty space
surrounded by a ring.

00:02:49.336 --> 00:02:56.009
Consume that empty hole deep
inside yourself, Donar Dantes.

00:02:57.052 --> 00:02:58.553
<i>Osore!</i>

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:02.599
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:03:02.599 --> 00:03:08.229
<i>Kimi o dakishimeru</i>
<i>nando mo nando mo nando mo</i>

00:03:08.229 --> 00:03:14.069
<i>Ashita boku wa kimi ni deau darou</i>

00:03:14.069 --> 00:03:19.824
<i>Wazuka na hoshi akari o tayori ni</i>

00:03:19.824 --> 00:03:25.872
<i>Boku ni wa kimi ga wakaru yo wakaru yo</i>

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:35.799
<i>Sen oku no toki o koe </i>
<i>futari hiraku densetsu no tobira</i>

00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:41.680
<i>Naraku no ao tobikoete</i>

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:47.477
<i>Kimi to hai ni naru tame</i>

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:58.405
<i>Nagaki rinne o</i>
<i>kanashimi tsurete tabi shite kitanda</i>

00:03:58.405 --> 00:04:01.408
<i>Zenryoku de mikansei</i>

00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:04.327
<i>Kimi no tonari de</i>

00:04:04.327 --> 00:04:10.125
<i>Kawaita kokoro hodoke chi o nagasu kedo</i>

00:04:10.125 --> 00:04:13.169
<i>Soba ni iru yo zutto</i>

00:04:13.169 --> 00:04:16.047
<i>Yorisotte zutto</i>

00:04:16.047 --> 00:04:20.719
<i>Futari hikari no fune ni noru</i>

00:04:20.719 --> 00:04:26.516
<i>Kaze no hajimari no oto kanadeyou (Mezame!)</i>

00:04:29.894 --> 00:04:33.898
♪ ...to wait while being torn to pieces ♪

00:04:33.898 --> 00:04:39.863
♪ A millennium, a million miles,
a moment in time ♪

00:04:39.863 --> 00:04:45.869
♪ Aquaria, Aquaria ♪

00:04:45.869 --> 00:04:48.788
♪ It descends down ♪

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:52.751
--♪ into my garden ♪
--Sir Jin, Sir Izumo would like to see you.

00:04:52.751 --> 00:04:58.673
--♪ and makes me strong even when... ♪
--Visual data of Alicia! Where'd you get such rare data?!

00:05:00.592 --> 00:05:03.178
What were you saying about Sir Izumo?

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:15.774
Hi.

00:05:15.774 --> 00:05:20.737
Jin, here are the results from analyzing
the battle data you brought back.

00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:23.281
When the Mechanical Angel's form changed,

00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:25.825
its ability parameters changed, too.

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:27.702
I can imagine...

00:05:27.702 --> 00:05:32.707
...as the way it fought before and after
the change was totally different.

00:05:33.917 --> 00:05:35.835
There's one more thing.

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:39.172
When it used that last technique...

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:42.467
...the data showed traces of a Rare Igura.

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:44.761
A Rare Igura was on board?!

00:05:46.471 --> 00:05:47.931
Sir Izumo.

00:05:47.931 --> 00:05:50.809
Sir Kagura has left on a sortie in Mithra Gnis.

00:05:50.809 --> 00:05:55.772
How imprudent of him... to try
to go to Vega with just a Gnis...

00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:57.357
Dimensional gate activated!

00:05:57.357 --> 00:05:58.858
What?

00:06:02.487 --> 00:06:05.824
Mithra Gnis has entered the transposition field!

00:06:05.824 --> 00:06:08.368
Who opened the gate?

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:11.788
Don't tell me... he woke up?

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:34.894
"Coed schooling starts today"

00:06:37.689 --> 00:06:39.983
So...

00:06:39.983 --> 00:06:43.069
...the St. Angel Academy is
a coed school starting today

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:45.864
and you are in the same class.

00:06:45.864 --> 00:06:49.075
I'm sure you feel a little
puzzled by the sudden change,

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:51.202
but please try to get along with each other.

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:57.917
Ahh, it's the real Shrade!

00:07:01.004 --> 00:07:03.256
The air is impure!

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:06.593
Our first class together is
a social studies field trip.

00:07:06.593 --> 00:07:11.681
You'll be exploring the Neo Kowloon
area as a coed group. Okay?

00:07:11.681 --> 00:07:14.559
How is that kind of class going to help?

00:07:14.559 --> 00:07:19.522
Whoa! Things are already
getting really exciting!

00:07:19.522 --> 00:07:21.066
Mikono...

00:07:26.905 --> 00:07:30.533
Amata! We're in the middle
of homeroom! Be quiet!

00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:32.410
Wh-What was that?

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:35.497
What?!

00:07:38.583 --> 00:07:41.252
I'll pass out the handouts.

00:07:41.252 --> 00:07:43.254
Take a walk around the promenade.

00:07:43.254 --> 00:07:45.548
Take an air stroll in the Kowloon Tower.

00:07:45.548 --> 00:07:48.593
Have dim sum at a hotel with a harbor view...?

00:07:48.593 --> 00:07:52.138
--This is like...
--...a list of popular date activities in Neo Kowloon!

00:07:52.138 --> 00:07:54.599
And, I'll hand these out to you, too.

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:58.436
--What the heck is this?
--How lame...

00:07:58.436 --> 00:08:00.438
Excuse me, don't I get one, too?

00:08:00.438 --> 00:08:02.857
The Director said that you wouldn't need one.

00:08:02.857 --> 00:08:04.818
What?

00:08:04.818 --> 00:08:06.903
I'll announce the groups now.

00:08:06.903 --> 00:08:10.115
Group A, Sierro, Enji and Youka.

00:08:10.115 --> 00:08:12.867
Group B, Malloy, Aika and Mist.

00:08:12.867 --> 00:08:14.828
Cute girl... Cute girl..

00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:18.123
Group C, Andy, Mix and Yunoha.

00:08:18.123 --> 00:08:19.791
Yunoha?

00:08:19.791 --> 00:08:21.459
Huh?

00:08:21.459 --> 00:08:24.295
I'm happy for you that you're with a cute girl.

00:08:24.295 --> 00:08:26.339
How cute!

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:29.009
Hey! This is a stuffed cat!

00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:30.510
Cat?

00:08:32.262 --> 00:08:35.765
Of all people, to think that
I'm with such a noisy guy!

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:41.146
She appears assertive, but she's cute!

00:08:41.146 --> 00:08:44.149
On top of that, she's really...

00:08:44.149 --> 00:08:45.650
Big bang!

00:08:49.237 --> 00:08:50.280
What's going on?!

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:54.659
Next group, Shrade, Cayenne, and Sazanka.

00:08:54.659 --> 00:08:57.328
Let's have fun, my good friend.

00:08:57.328 --> 00:08:58.872
Who'd want to shake hands with you?!

00:08:58.872 --> 00:09:01.916
Being in the same group as
you sets my heart at ease.

00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.501
I know you don't mean that.

00:09:03.501 --> 00:09:05.128
Do you now?

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:13.094
The last group, Amata, Mikono and Zessica.

00:09:13.094 --> 00:09:14.596
L-Let's have fun.

00:09:14.596 --> 00:09:16.139
Yeah.

00:09:21.561 --> 00:09:25.482
Well then, each group will
go its separate way from here.

00:09:25.482 --> 00:09:28.693
Make sure you won't be late
for the boat heading back.

00:09:28.693 --> 00:09:29.736
Understood?

00:09:29.736 --> 00:09:30.487
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:30.487 --> 00:09:33.198
"Neo Kowloon"

00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:02.686
The Elements are receiving
numerous electric shocks!

00:10:02.686 --> 00:10:05.105
They're inexperienced, aren't they...?

00:10:05.105 --> 00:10:07.065
What is this armlet?

00:10:07.065 --> 00:10:11.695
It monitors Elements' body temperature,
heart rate, perspiration, et cetera,

00:10:11.695 --> 00:10:14.948
and once the values exceed a certain number,
it electrocutes the Elements.

00:10:14.948 --> 00:10:16.825
I think that's in poor taste!

00:10:16.825 --> 00:10:20.245
Is there any point to such a
ridiculous training exercise?!

00:10:20.245 --> 00:10:21.538
There is.

00:10:21.538 --> 00:10:25.917
This training is vital for Elements to be
able to exhibit their abilities to the fullest

00:10:25.917 --> 00:10:30.672
and to avoid the tragedy of Aquarion.

00:10:30.672 --> 00:10:33.633
Tragedy of Aquarion...

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:38.471
Nine years ago, when Aquarion
fought at the time of the first raid,

00:10:38.471 --> 00:10:41.224
it went out of control
right in the midst of battle.

00:10:41.224 --> 00:10:43.935
Two Elements went missing.

00:10:43.935 --> 00:10:50.066
The only survivor, Donar Dantes,
lost both his arms and someone he loved.

00:10:53.528 --> 00:10:55.697
They throb with pain...

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:12.380
"Warning!" "Warning!"

00:11:12.505 --> 00:11:13.381
"Danger" "Danger"

00:11:37.614 --> 00:11:40.575
The melody of love is transient.

00:11:46.581 --> 00:11:48.833
N-Nanaon!

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:50.377
Donar!

00:12:01.513 --> 00:12:05.725
Aquarion syncs with the Elements'
multidimensional feelings

00:12:05.725 --> 00:12:08.687
and fights by enhancing that power.

00:12:08.687 --> 00:12:12.816
The intensity of their feelings are
directly connected to Aquarion's strength.

00:12:12.816 --> 00:12:17.445
Of people's emotions, which is
most intense and passionate?

00:12:17.445 --> 00:12:20.031
Can you answer that, Miss Suomi?

00:12:20.031 --> 00:12:21.825
Perhaps something like a grudge or jealousy?

00:12:21.825 --> 00:12:23.993
--No.
--What?!

00:12:23.993 --> 00:12:25.453
The answer is "being in love."

00:12:25.453 --> 00:12:26.538
"Being in love"?

00:12:26.538 --> 00:12:31.292
However, it has to stay at
the level of "being in love."

00:12:31.292 --> 00:12:34.879
If by some circumstance it
develops into a real romance,

00:12:34.879 --> 00:12:38.049
Aquarion will go out of control...

00:12:38.049 --> 00:12:43.054
...just like the tragedy that Donar
and his loved one encountered.

00:12:43.054 --> 00:12:46.141
But if they fight right when they are
about to reach that forbidden point

00:12:46.141 --> 00:12:50.020
at the very moment before
a true romance blossoms,

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:53.189
Aquarion exhibits tremendous power.

00:12:56.026 --> 00:12:58.862
The relationship between
Amata Sora and Mikono Suzushiro

00:12:58.862 --> 00:13:01.906
was nearing the point of an
actual romance at that time.

00:13:01.906 --> 00:13:05.410
That's exactly why the forbidden
technique was invoked.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:10.290
This armlet probes the
wearer's feelings of love.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:14.461
What we seek is the power Aquarion
exhibits right before it goes out of control.

00:13:14.461 --> 00:13:17.881
This training is indeed for stopping
a romance right before it blossoms.

00:13:17.881 --> 00:13:23.762
That's right. I can't allow my precious
students to go through what I did.

00:13:23.762 --> 00:13:25.430
Especially Amata...

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:29.392
He resembles me in my younger days.

00:13:29.392 --> 00:13:31.102
So I...

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:39.110
Wow, this is cute!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:42.072
Look, Shushu, it's a cat.

00:13:42.072 --> 00:13:46.034
Cute...? Mikono is a lot cuter.

00:13:51.122 --> 00:13:53.041
Ow!

00:13:53.041 --> 00:13:54.125
Amata?!

00:13:54.125 --> 00:13:55.168
What happened?

00:13:55.168 --> 00:13:57.337
My butt...! Ow...

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:01.424
Romance is prohibited, Amata.

00:14:01.424 --> 00:14:04.886
Seriously, I can't let him out
of my sights for a second.

00:14:21.403 --> 00:14:22.904
I smell it.

00:14:27.617 --> 00:14:31.121
A social studies field trip
to a pool at a fancy hotel...

00:14:31.121 --> 00:14:35.250
On top of that, they even lent
us swimsuits... It's perfect, but...

00:14:37.919 --> 00:14:41.256
...what the hell's the deal
with this stuffed animal?

00:14:41.256 --> 00:14:42.799
Thanks for waiting.

00:14:51.433 --> 00:14:53.309
I-I'm gonna die...

00:14:54.519 --> 00:14:56.187
Huh?

00:14:56.187 --> 00:15:01.067
This training also simulates
possible Element combinations.

00:15:01.067 --> 00:15:03.695
If what you say is true, Director,

00:15:03.695 --> 00:15:08.033
could Mix be an important asset since
she doesn't give her heart to boys?

00:15:08.033 --> 00:15:11.953
No, so long as she shuts
her heart to boys like that,

00:15:11.953 --> 00:15:15.832
it'll probably be difficult to reach the
point right before a romance blossoms.

00:15:15.832 --> 00:15:19.419
Then, how about the Shrade,
Cayenne and Sazanka team?

00:15:20.712 --> 00:15:23.882
To think that they designated the
restaurant and even the dishes...

00:15:23.882 --> 00:15:25.467
I find it annoying.

00:15:25.467 --> 00:15:29.554
Thank you for waiting.
Here's your watermelon juice.

00:15:29.554 --> 00:15:31.681
Excuse me, but we get just one glass?

00:15:31.681 --> 00:15:34.726
Those are our instructions, so...

00:15:34.726 --> 00:15:36.061
Now, let's drink, shall we?

00:15:36.061 --> 00:15:38.605
--What?
--This is part of the training, right?

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:40.190
We have no choice.

00:15:41.483 --> 00:15:45.528
It seems that being around a girl
has made him shy. Sorry about that.

00:15:45.528 --> 00:15:47.238
I-I see...

00:15:54.496 --> 00:16:00.168
Ahh... Shrade and Cayenne are
drinking juice from the same glass!

00:16:05.924 --> 00:16:09.177
Shrade seems calm, doesn't he...?

00:16:09.177 --> 00:16:14.057
Just as you'd expect from him, though Sazanka
has been electrocuted for the wrong reasons.

00:16:14.057 --> 00:16:17.185
Director. We can't put Shrade in a real battle.

00:16:17.185 --> 00:16:20.271
I know about his physical condition.

00:16:20.271 --> 00:16:24.109
Shrade Elan is on the edge of his life,

00:16:24.109 --> 00:16:28.530
which you could say is an ideal state to
create the feeling of being on the edge.

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.781
How cruel...

00:16:29.781 --> 00:16:35.954
And the most notable combination
is Amata, Zessica and Mikono.

00:16:35.954 --> 00:16:40.625
But no Element power
was detected from Mikono.

00:16:40.625 --> 00:16:46.965
Unless surrounded by a ring,
a donut is nothing but empty space.

00:16:46.965 --> 00:16:52.512
Mikono Suzushiro is the ring that
makes a donut out of that empty space.

00:16:52.512 --> 00:16:56.641
However... sweet things...

00:16:58.309 --> 00:17:00.478
Ow!

00:17:00.478 --> 00:17:01.938
Are you okay?

00:17:01.938 --> 00:17:07.152
Tsk! He floats too much! No amount
of darts would be enough for him!

00:17:07.152 --> 00:17:10.363
--Ow...
--Amata's heart went pitter-patter from watching me.

00:17:10.363 --> 00:17:11.865
That's why...

00:17:13.033 --> 00:17:14.325
Amata, you're such a...

00:17:14.325 --> 00:17:17.078
You sure look happy, Mikono.

00:17:17.078 --> 00:17:19.748
I'm jealous. Is your composure coming
from knowing someone likes you?

00:17:19.748 --> 00:17:21.166
That's not true!

00:17:21.166 --> 00:17:27.505
Really? Innocent guys like him are my type.

00:17:27.505 --> 00:17:29.841
Th-The next place is...

00:17:29.841 --> 00:17:33.094
Amata! Let's walk together!

00:17:33.094 --> 00:17:33.511
Okay?

00:17:33.511 --> 00:17:35.013
What?!

00:17:37.182 --> 00:17:40.226
Whoa! You float for me too!

00:17:40.226 --> 00:17:43.688
Amata... Do you float
no matter who the girl is?!

00:17:43.688 --> 00:17:44.731
What?!

00:17:44.731 --> 00:17:46.983
It's not like anyone would do, right?

00:17:46.983 --> 00:17:49.110
It's because of me.

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:51.071
Ow!

00:17:53.907 --> 00:17:55.492
What's wrong, Shushu?

00:18:01.039 --> 00:18:03.249
Whoa! What's with him?!

00:18:03.249 --> 00:18:07.629
B-But don't you think he's kinda handsome?

00:18:13.093 --> 00:18:14.928
No, this one smells good.

00:18:14.928 --> 00:18:16.429
Huh?!

00:18:21.434 --> 00:18:23.103
Are you okay?

00:18:23.103 --> 00:18:25.271
You can rest a bit here.

00:18:28.233 --> 00:18:31.903
Are you upset about what
I did in the last battle?

00:18:31.903 --> 00:18:35.573
There's no point in talking to someone
who manipulates people's minds.

00:18:35.573 --> 00:18:40.912
What's the problem? With me,
my life itself is being manipulated...

00:18:40.912 --> 00:18:44.124
...by an Abductor named illness.

00:19:00.598 --> 00:19:02.100
Three tickets for air strolling!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.102
What?! Do I have to do it, too?!

00:19:04.102 --> 00:19:05.979
Well, this is training, so...

00:19:05.979 --> 00:19:08.440
If you're scared, you don't
have to push yourself.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.108
Let's have fun by ourselves, Amata!

00:19:10.108 --> 00:19:12.110
Hey, don't cling to me!

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:15.280
This is so amusing!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:18.742
Yeah. Looks like I'm in your way.
Go right ahead and have fun by yourselves!

00:19:18.742 --> 00:19:21.745
Mikono! Wait!

00:19:23.788 --> 00:19:25.957
Mikono, wait! I...

00:19:25.957 --> 00:19:27.792
You've got a dirty mind, Amata!

00:19:27.792 --> 00:19:28.877
What?!

00:19:28.877 --> 00:19:31.212
You keep floating for Zessica!

00:19:32.464 --> 00:19:35.133
I thought... it was just with me.

00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:37.135
What? What did you just say?

00:19:37.135 --> 00:19:38.178
Never mind!

00:19:38.178 --> 00:19:39.679
Mikono!

00:19:52.734 --> 00:19:54.694
It looks like it's burning.

00:19:54.694 --> 00:19:57.155
Yeah, it looks just like...

00:19:57.155 --> 00:19:59.240
"Skies of Aquaria"...

00:20:10.543 --> 00:20:12.087
This music...

00:20:26.267 --> 00:20:27.769
It kinda makes me feel nostalgic...

00:20:27.769 --> 00:20:29.187
Huh?

00:20:29.187 --> 00:20:34.067
Even though I just met you recently,

00:20:34.067 --> 00:20:37.529
it feels like it was a long time ago.

00:20:37.529 --> 00:20:39.072
How strange...

00:20:40.156 --> 00:20:43.201
I don't think it's strange...

00:20:43.201 --> 00:20:48.081
...because I felt that meeting you... was fate.

00:20:51.543 --> 00:20:52.711
Are you okay?!

00:20:52.711 --> 00:20:54.254
What am I saying?

00:20:54.254 --> 00:20:57.632
Sorry! Forget what I just said! Okay?!

00:20:57.632 --> 00:20:59.384
You want me to forget?

00:21:01.261 --> 00:21:03.388
I don't want to forget!

00:21:03.388 --> 00:21:04.931
Mikono...

00:21:12.188 --> 00:21:15.692
This isn't good! Mikono's romance
index is rapidly increasing!

00:21:25.744 --> 00:21:27.078
"Warning"

00:21:27.412 --> 00:21:29.789
--This is bad!
--Unless they're stopped, a romance will blossom!

00:21:29.789 --> 00:21:32.125
Mr. Donar! Stop those two!

00:21:32.125 --> 00:21:33.752
Tsk!

00:21:33.752 --> 00:21:36.421
I'm too far away!

00:21:36.421 --> 00:21:37.922
Amata!

00:21:48.433 --> 00:21:49.059
"Danger"

00:21:49.059 --> 00:21:49.934
"Danger"
No!

00:21:49.934 --> 00:21:51.978
Amata! Mikono!

00:21:51.978 --> 00:21:53.146
No!

00:21:53.146 --> 00:21:56.441
Forbidden love is as sweet as honey.

00:21:56.441 --> 00:22:00.779
But sweet honey attracts ants.

00:22:05.909 --> 00:22:07.410
I found you!

00:22:16.211 --> 00:22:17.879
--You stink.
--What?

00:22:21.299 --> 00:22:23.677
You stink and taste sweet.

00:22:27.806 --> 00:22:28.640
Mikono!

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:30.100
"Out of control"

00:22:30.392 --> 00:22:32.143
This reaction is...

00:22:32.143 --> 00:22:34.646
It's not a romance. This is...

00:22:36.314 --> 00:22:38.400
...a forbidden encounter.

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:38.942
"Romance is prohibited"

00:22:44.614 --> 00:22:46.116
Mikono!

00:22:47.117 --> 00:22:49.452
Mikono!

00:22:56.167 --> 00:23:01.631
<i>Kaze ni ubawareta wake janai</i>

00:23:01.631 --> 00:23:04.509
<i>Katamichi bun no yuuki de</i>

00:23:04.509 --> 00:23:12.308
<i>Bokura higeki o ukeireru</i>

00:23:12.308 --> 00:23:17.022
<i>Kokoro ga koko ni atta hazu no kuudou</i>

00:23:17.022 --> 00:23:19.607
<i>Motto boku ga ookikereba</i>

00:23:19.607 --> 00:23:25.280
<i>Kimi o mirai o sukueta darou ka</i>

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:32.579
<i>Taisetsu na hito o mamoru sube o</i>
<i>tatta hitotsu shika motanai</i>

00:23:32.579 --> 00:23:39.419
<i>Sonna anata ga hagure tadayou sora</i>

00:23:39.419 --> 00:23:47.135
<i>Anata ijou no hito ni deaenai</i>

00:23:47.135 --> 00:23:53.600
<i>Tsuki ni aragau nagai furea</i>

00:23:53.600 --> 00:24:00.148
<i>Hajimari mo sezu owaru monogatari</i>

00:24:00.148 --> 00:24:06.112
<i>Kizutsukiuru yawarakasa tojikometa senritsu</i>

00:24:06.112 --> 00:24:09.157
<i>Kanaderu hodo utau hodo</i>

00:24:09.157 --> 00:24:14.621
<i>Kowareru hodo ni</i>

00:24:14.621 --> 00:24:21.544
<i>Anataga koishii</i>

00:24:23.129 --> 00:24:26.257
Let's talk about what will happen
seven days from now, shall we?

00:24:26.257 --> 00:24:30.345
I bet this scherzando battle
will D.S. al darkness.

00:24:30.345 --> 00:24:32.681
Right, my good friend?

00:24:33.264 --> 00:24:34.683
"Next Episode 'Agitato of Life'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:34.683 --> 00:24:37.163
"Next Episode 'Agitato of Life'"
"Agitato of Life."
